  "body": [
    "Register for Fall Programming! Session runs now - Nov 8.",
    "PLAY PLAY submenu Programs Private Lessons Adult Camps Summer Camps Book a Court Free30 Dave Bailey Programs",
    "EVENTS EVENTS submenu Calendar 2026 BNP Paribas World Team Cup",
    "ABOUT ABOUT submenu Meet Our Team Contact Us Sponsors & Partners USTA National Campus Scholarship",
    "WATCH WATCH submenu Watch Live Record Your Match",
    "VISIT VISIT submenu Hotel Booking Sustainability Health & Wellness Shop",
    "Home >",
    "Events",
    "The USTA National Campus is hosting the 2026 BNP Paribas World Team Cup from September 16-19th. You're invited to experience the action up close for FREE!",
    "Our Collegiate Center is a premier destination for collegiate tennis and is the home of UCF Tennis.",
    "Our facility provides exceptional spaces for corporate events, offering customizable experiences that blend racquet sports and team-building.",
    "Celebrate your special day with a fun-filled racquet sport-themed party, activities, coaching, and a unique experience for all your guests.",
    "Perfect outing for groups offering customized racquet sports and team-building experiences where you can try tennis, pickleball, and padel.",
    "View our versatile spaces equipped with modern amenities, providing an ideal setting for your events within a dynamic sports environment.",
    "Location: Team USA 1-20",
    "LEARN MORE",
    "Get active, learn new skills, and connect with fellow service members and families.",
    "REGISTER FOR FREE",
    "Join SOUL Ambassador Ana from Studio SOUL for a revitalizing 50-minute Vinyasa Yoga session!",
    "REGISTER FOR FREE",
    "Bring the whole crew out for a morning of on-court activities for all ages and skill levels, face painting for the kids, and more to kickstart your weekend! REGISTER FOR FREE",
    "Monday - Friday 7:00 AM - 9:00 PM",
    "Saturday 7:00 AM - 5:00 PM",
    "Sunday 7:00 AM - 5:00 PM",
    "VIEW HOLIDAY HOURS",
